        "original_id": "d06f9d71-ad13-5a79-91df-25e741323983",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Flipper (1996 film), Flipper (1963 film), The Lord of the Rings film trilogy\n- Television: Flipper TV series\n- People: Elijah Wood, Paul Hogan, Peter Jackson\n- Roles: Frodo Baggins\n\nFacts:\n- The 1963 film Flipper was adapted into a Flipper television series that ran from 1964 to 1967.\n- Flipper is a 1996 adventure film remake of the 1963 film Flipper.\n- The 1996 film Flipper stars Paul Hogan and Elijah Wood.\n- Elijah Wood is best known for playing Frodo Baggins in Peter Jackson's The Lord of the Rings film trilogy from 2001 to 2003.",
